// Obscura's earlier identity (G-38), included by Signing.xcconfig.
// A build that names the bundle identifier an earlier build of the same copy ran under carries that identity's settings,
// Keychain items, Spotlight entries and login item over at its first launch (IdentityMigration). Every public build
// leaves it empty: nothing is carried and nothing about an earlier identity is in the app. A Mac that ran an earlier
// private build sets it once, in the git-ignored Signing.local.xcconfig (read after this file):
//   OBSCURA_PREVIOUS_IDENTITY = <the earlier bundle identifier>
// and removes it again once that build has run. Scripts/check-app-signature.sh --release refuses a build that names one.
OBSCURA_PREVIOUS_IDENTITY =
